# chlorpromazine.msf
# Chlorpromazine  pKa=9.300 (dimethylammonium→amine, q=+1→0)
# Source: Perrin 1981
# First-generation antipsychotic (D2-blocker). Tertiary amine (NMe2) on
# a 3-carbon chain attached to the phenothiazine N. The phenothiazine ring
# system (sulphur + nitrogen bridged biaryl) creates a very distinct ΔBO_ring
# and ΔBO_XC pattern compared to all other training compounds.
# The Cl substituent at 2-position of the phenothiazine provides mild EW.
# Tests the phenothiazine scaffold — completely new to the training set.

